OL,3,GNEWSAYouth club 'devastated' for kids
OL,4,Aover closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA youth club says it is "devastated"
OL,7,Fafter a funding fallout meant it had to
OL,8,Fleave its building.
OL,10,FKirkby Stephen Youth Centre (KSYC),
OL,11,Fbased in the Evergreen Building in the
OL,12,FCumbrian town, ran its final session at
OL,13,Fthe site last month saying delays meant
OL,14,Fit failed to secure enough grant money
OL,15,Fto bid to keep running there.
OL,17,FThe Evergreen Community Trust, which
OL,18,Flooks after the building, said KSYC's
OL,19,Ftenancy had come to an end and it had
OL,20,Fundergone a "fair" process to pick a
OL,21,Fnew provider.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
