OL,3,GNEWSAYouth club 'devastated' for kids
OL,4,Aover closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrust chair John Murray said: "I really
OL,7,Fdo regret that people have got so upset
OL,8,Fand cross with each other", adding he
OL,9,Fexpected youth provision to restart
OL,10,Fwith a new operator by half-term.
